## 9. Verification Plan

### 9.1 Manual Test Matrix

| # | Test | Steps | Expected Result |
|---|------|-------|-----------------|
| T1 | SAML login → logout | Login via ADFS → Click "Cerrar Sesion" | ADFS LogoutRequest sent, redirected to index.php |
| T2 | DB login → logout | Login via local form → Click "Cerrar Sesion" | Direct redirect to index.php, no IdP contact |
| T3 | SAML login → re-auth after logout | T1 → Click "Ingresar con Correo Institucional" | ADFS prompts for credentials (no auto SSO) |
| T4 | Admin wrong password | Enter ADMINISTRADOR + wrong password | "Usuario o contraseña incorrectos" |
| T5 | Admin correct password | Enter ADMINISTRADOR + correct password | Login succeeds, usua_codi > 0 in session |
| T6 | Session timeout | Wait 31 min → click any action | paginaError.php with link to index.php |
| T7 | IdP-initiated SLO | ADFS admin forces logout | Quipux session destroyed, redirect to index.php |
| T8 | Post-logout portal | Any logout path | index.php shows both SAML and Local buttons |

### 9.2 Automated Checks

```bash
# Verify no bypass remains
grep -rn "ADMINISTRADOR" login_ldap.php | grep -v "//\|comment"
# Expected: no matches (bypass removed)

# Verify all redirects point to index.php
grep -rn "login\.php" cerrar_session.php saml/sls.php paginaError.php rec_session.php
# Expected: no matches (all changed to index.php)

# Verify auth_method is set
grep -rn "auth_method" saml/accs.php login.php cerrar_session.php
# Expected: 3 matches (set in accs, set in login, read in cerrar_session)

# Verify SessionManager usage
grep -rn "SessionManager" cerrar_session.php
# Expected: match found
```

---

## 10. Rollback Plan

If issues arise after deployment:

| Phase | Rollback |
|-------|----------|
| Phase 1.1 (REQ-4) | Re-add bypass block in `login_ldap.php` and `rec_session.php`. **Only if** admin access is blocked and no DB fix is possible. |
| Phase 1.2 (REQ-1) | Remove `auth_method` lines from `accs.php` and `login.php`. No side effects. |
| Phase 2.1 (REQ-5) | Replace SessionManager call with manual foreach + session_destroy. |
| Phase 2.2 (REQ-3) | Change index.php redirects back to login.php. |
| Phase 2.3 (REQ-2) | Remove SLO conditional — always redirect to index.php (skip SLS). This reverts to local-only logout. |

